   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution consists of components which each is a different activity. The activities are mainly workshops, meetings and  conferences organised by the HIV/AIDS team on various HIV/AIDS related topics. One standing annual meeting is e.g. the focal point meeting for HIV/AIDS focal points at Swedish and Norwegian Embassies.</narrative>
